  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text">From the back office homepage, a summary overview gives you an instant view of your business: revenue generated, total number of transactions, and average basket value for the last month. These indicators allow you to manage your business on a daily basis and quickly identify trends or areas for optimization.</p>
                </div>
