  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text">Download all the accounting documents needed to manage your collections. The daily transaction statement details each payment collected, specifying the fees associated with each transaction. The monthly statement provides an overall summary of the month's transactions. Finally, a monthly invoice is automatically generated, including the total fees applied, directly linked to the amounts shown in the monthly statement.</p>
                </div>
