  </svg></div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_text-wrapper">
                  <p class="tab_faq-text">You can automatically identify the origin of bank cards used (France, United States, Asia, etc.), and know if a card has already been used at your establishment or if it is a new customer. This data allows you to better understand the profiles of your visitors and optimize your loyalty strategy.</p>
