          <h2 class="h2-logos-prix left-kiosk center-mob"><span class="gradient-text">How to get the most out</span> of IO PAY?</h2>
          <div data-w-id="2503796e-39d0-5a42-f012-83df328739f2" style="opacity:0" class="_18px text-align-center max-width-1000">IO Pay works seamlessly with all the tools in the Innovorder ecosystem. It is designed to adapt to all sales configurations, while ensuring a simple, fast, and frictionless payment process.</div>
          <div class="nf525-q-section margin-top-24">
            <div class="nf525-expandable-wrap">
              <div class="nf525-q-expandable-item bordered">
                <div class="nf525-expandable-content">
                  <div class="nf525-faq-heading-row">
                    <h3 class="nf525-faq-heading">Rely on perfect synchronization with your cash register</h3>
                    <div class="expand-icon-wrap">
                      <div class="expand-line vertical"></div>
                      <div class="expand-line"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="expandable-open">
                    <div class="expand-space"></div>
                    <div>At checkout, IO Pay enables seamless payment processing, fully integrated into your sales interface. As soon as the order is validated, the amount is automatically displayed on the terminal, without manual re-entry. This significantly reduces data entry errors and speeds up each transaction, especially during busy periods.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="nf525-q-expandable-item bordered">
                <div class="nf525-expandable-content">
                  <div class="nf525-faq-heading-row">
                    <h3 class="nf525-faq-heading">Offer a self-service payment experience at a kiosk</h3>
                    <div class="expand-icon-wrap">
                      <div class="expand-line vertical"></div>
                      <div class="expand-line"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="expandable-open">
                    <div class="expand-space"></div>
                    <div>Terminals equipped with Tap to Pay technology work directly with IO Pay, allowing you to collect payments from your customers without a traditional payment terminal (EPT) or the associated fees. Payment is made seamlessly and autonomously upon ordering, reducing queues and improving the customer experience.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="nf525-q-expandable-item bordered">
                <div class="nf525-expandable-content">
                  <div class="nf525-faq-heading-row">
                    <h3 class="nf525-faq-heading">A clear back office for simplified payment management</h3>
                    <div class="expand-icon-wrap">
                      <div class="expand-line vertical"></div>
                      <div class="expand-line"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="expandable-open">
                    <div class="expand-space"></div>
                    <div>The IO Pay back office centralizes all your payments, in real time, regardless of the channels used (checkout, terminal, AI Scan). You can access detailed reports, by day, site, or payment method, with the ability to compare performance between establishments.</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
