      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="51d0ba32-eb86-4c07-52c3-f7ec15af468d" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left"><span class="gradient-text">Questions</span> about our payment solution?</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e7b-d8d95a47" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e7b" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How much does IO Pay cost? What are the associated fees?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">IO Pay pricing is based on :<br></div>
              <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                <li>purchase of a TPE or any existing SoftPos-compatible hardware,</li>
                <li>IO Pay license subscription,</li>
                <li>and transaction commissions with the opening of an Innovorder electronic banking contract.</li>
              </ul>
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To receive a quotation specific to your activity, contact an Innovorder expert.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e86-d8d95a47" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e86" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How do you install IO Pay in your restaurant?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">An IO Pay electronic payment contract must first be set up. IO Pay is then installed and configured directly by our team, on site or remotely, on the same day.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e91-d8d95a47" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e91" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Why equip your restaurant with IO Pay rather than with your bank or current payment provider?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">IO Pay offers competitive rates and can be deployed on the latest generation of Android hardware including SoftPos (POS terminals, cash registers, kiosks).<br><br>The IO Pay backoffice lets you manage all your terminals and easily reconcile your payments with your cash receipts. This saves you time and money on a daily basis.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e9c-d8d95a47" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2e9c" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Is IO Pay a secure solution?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">IO Pay guarantees a secure payment experience and protects you from the risk of fraud.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2ea7-d8d95a47" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2ea7" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Do I need special equipment to benefit from IO Pay?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">To take advantage of IO Pay without any constraints, you need to equip yourself with one of the following:<br></div>
              <ul role="list" class="bullets-expertise-block _17">
                <li>Android-compatible Pax or Sunmi VSEs,</li>
                <li>our latest generation of cash registers (Nano, Move, Pro or Max) featuring SoftPos contactless payment,</li>
                <li>or our order terminal, featuring SoftPos contactless payment.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2eb2-d8d95a47" data-w-id="08ed7327-4b28-fda0-66eb-aa9a462d2eb2" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How long does it take for the money to reach the account?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">For CB, Visa and Mastercard payments, your funds are transferred on D+1. For other payments (luncheon vouchers, etc.), funds are transferred according to your existing contract.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_89c21932-995f-57ce-6c7a-a8a5492a7877-d8d95a47" data-w-id="89c21932-995f-57ce-6c7a-a8a5492a7877" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What commissions are applied?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Commission rates are competitive and transparent. They vary depending on the type of card used (CB, Visa, Amex, meal vouchers, etc.) but remain equivalent to those charged by traditional banks. You have access to a complete breakdown of commissions per transaction in the IO Pay back office. To learn more, contact an Innovorder expert.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_799e3039-cae4-5d44-fe45-ab1fe00985f8-d8d95a47" data-w-id="799e3039-cae4-5d44-fe45-ab1fe00985f8" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Who manages the installation and monitoring?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Everything is managed by Innovorder. From hardware to technical support, including maintenance and payment tracking, you have a single point of contact for the entire solution. Installation is turnkey, and you don't need to take any additional steps.<br></div>
